Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sickened subconscious,\NNestled in anguish,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In thoughts that bid me\NTo rot and to languish,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneeling to pleas\NOf selfish desires,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In forests of trees\NBlazing with fires,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The branches—they lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow draws in\NOn the whispering sigh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the wandering wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A message inscribed\NBy no hand that was,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That words can’t describe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor silence can cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For the fire still burns
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,While time marches on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody learns\NThe meaning of dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is free,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For nothing is seen—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest of trees
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stares at the breeze.
